IMAGE_FETCH
===========

This project ports camera-protocol and file-workflow code from the ZENCHE project
(https://github.com/Tauber01/ZENCHE), which is licensed under the MIT License.

Ported / adapted source files include (non-exhaustive):

  - app/src/main/java/com/imagefetch/ptp/CameraStorage.java
      adapted from ZENCHE native/android/.../CameraStorage.java
  - app/src/main/java/com/imagefetch/ptp/PtpIpTransport.java
      adapted from ZENCHE native/android/.../PtpIpCamera.java
  - app/src/main/java/com/imagefetch/storage/PhotoRepository.java
      adapted from ZENCHE native/android/.../CaptureWorkflow.java

