t3mujinpack HaldCLUT-derived LUTs

The 51 files under app/src/main/assets/luts/ are converted from the complete
haldcluts directory of t3mujinpack (https://github.com/t3mujin/t3mujinpack),
downsampled from the original 144-level HaldCLUT PNGs to 33x33x33 .cube tables
(Black and White 12, Color Negative 24, Color Slide 15). The conversion only
resamples the color data and rewrites the container format; no other
modification was made.

